Basic Features (Must Have) = 
User Signup & Login
Add Habit
Set Time for Habit
Mark Habit as Done / Not Done
Daily Habit Tracking

Core Features (Important) = 
Streak System
Edit Habit
Delete Habit
Multiple Habits per User
Habit History (past records)

Advanced Features (Optional but Powerful) =
Reminder / Notification
Progress / Analytics (success rate)
Habit Categories
Weekly / Monthly View
Custom Frequency (daily / weekly)






